DESCRIPTION:OUR GROUP HEALTH PLAN IS MOVING FORWARD! JOIN US FOR UPDATES & A LIVE Q&A: Featuring Agency Network & NASFA\n\nAgency Solutions LIVE | Tuesday, September 1, 2026 | 1:00 PM Eastern\n\nAgency joins Agency Solutions LIVE for a practical\, live session on Our Group Health Plan is Moving Forward! Join us for Updates & a LIVE Q&A - the kind of call you leave with something you can use the same week.\n\nWe'll get into Join us this Tuesday\, 09/01/2026 @ 1:00PM EST for a live call about the new nationwide group health plan for agents and team members!\, We will be hearing from our broker\, Tyrone Jordan (TJ)\, at Brown & Brown about the group plan through Blue Cross Blue Shield of IL\, This is officially happening now and we couldn't be more excited! Come hear about the plan\, timing and next steps. Unfortunately we all have a bit of work to do before pricing is ready\, so we really need you on this call!\, and Have your questions ready so we can prepare TJ in advance - plus a live Q&A at the end.\n\nFree to attend and live on Zoom. Bring your questions for Agency.\n\nJoin via Zoom:\nhttps://us06web.zoom.us/j/89011868237\n\nMeeting ID: 890 1186 8237\nPasscode: Not required\n\nConnecting Agents - Inspiring Greatness\nAgency Network
